flowchart LR
    SRC["Source files<br/>main.tq + imports + std/*.tq"] --> LEX[Lexer]
    LEX --> PARSE[Parser]
    PARSE --> AST[(AST per module)]
    AST --> SEM["Semantic analysis<br/>+ code generation<br/>(one pass)"]
    SEM --> PEEP[Peephole optimizer]
    PEEP --> BC[(Verified bytecode<br/>Program)]
    BC -->|tacqor run| VM["Bytecode VM<br/>threaded dispatch"]
    BC -->|tacqor compile| TQB[".tqb file<br/>portable bytecode"]
    BC -->|tacqor build| EXE1["Executable<br/>VM + bytecode embedded"]
    BC -->|tacqor build --native| NAT["Native backend<br/>typed C++ generator"]
    NAT --> CXX["System C++ compiler<br/>GCC / Clang / MSVC, -O3"]
    CXX --> EXE2["Native executable"]
    BC -->|tacqor check / diagnose| DIAG["Diagnostics<br/>text or JSON for editors"]
    BC -->|tacqor dump| DIS[Disassembly]
